ly. With the expert leadership of prominent figures such as Shri B K Chaturvedi, Chairman DPSS, and Shri V K Shunglu, Vice Chairman, DPSS, the foundation of DPS vision and mission is developed, communicated, and shared among the DPS community. DPSS equips educators with skill, dedication, and inspiration. It promotes the adoption of effective teaching methods with an emphasis on collaborative learning and skill enhancement.<\/span>","content_type":"text","image_path":null,"image_url":null,"link_url":null,"video_path":null,"video_url":null,"table_data":null,"accordion_data":null,"order":1,"is_active":true,"created_at":"2025-09-22T05:17:03.097000Z","updated_at":"2025-09-22T05:17:03.097000Z","page_section_id":"1522","content_heading":"DPS Society content section eldeco","alignment":null,"image_alt":null,"column_type":null,"width":"50","image_width":null,"image_height":null,"content_item_id":null,"content_item_type":null}]}]}}